            "claim": "Relations (5) and (6) are homogeneous of degree $0$: in (5) the two sides move the same pair of crossings; in (6) the case $b\\notin\\{a,a+1\\}$ moves a dot past a crossing of the same two strands, and the remaining case $\\nu_a=\\nu_{a+1}$ has ",
